            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy model within 3&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Both player&apos;s roll off. If you win the roll-off, pick a melee weapon that the target is armed with. Your opponent must pick a visible unit in their army within 3&quot; of the target (they can pick the target&apos;s own unit, and even if it is a single-model unit).
Your opponent must resolve combat attacks for the target using the melee weapon you picked against the unit they picked.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
