            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If the casting roll for an enemy **^^Wizard^^** within 12&quot; of this unit contains 2 or more results of 1 or 2, the spell is miscast.
If the chanting roll for an enemy **^^Priest^^** within 12&quot; of this unit is an unmodified 2, the prayer fails and its effect is not resolved. In addition, your opponent cannot give that **^^Priest^^** any ritual points for the rest of the phase.</characteristic>
