          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">The following cumulative effects apply depending on the number of models in this unit that are slain.
**1+** Add 1 to charge rolls for this unit.
**4+** Add 1 to hit rolls for this unit&apos;s combat attacks.
**8+** Add 1 to wound rolls for this unit&apos;s combat attacks.
**16+** Double the Attacks characteristic of this unit&apos;s melee weapons and this unit&apos;s combat attacks score critical hits on unmodified hit rolls of 5+.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
